        {
          "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/12527297/comment/13128210",
          "id": "13128210",
          "author": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=simonw",
            "name": "simonw",
            "key": "simonw",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"
            },
            "displayName": "Simon Willnauer",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Etc/UTC"
          },
          "body": "mike, I just had a quick look but is this intentionally?\n{code}\n-      return IndexReader.openIfChanged(oldReader, writer, applyDeletes);\n+      return IndexReader.openIfChanged(oldReader, applyDeletes);\n{code}\n\nseems like you are not opening a NRT reader there anymore?",
          "updateAuthor": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=simonw",
            "name": "simonw",
            "key": "simonw",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"
            },
            "displayName": "Simon Willnauer",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "Etc/UTC"
          },
          "created": "2011-10-15T14:50:24.732+0000",
          "updated": "2011-10-15T14:50:24.732+0000"
        },
        {
          "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/12527297/comment/13128229",
          "id": "13128229",
          "author": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=mikemccand",
            "name": "mikemccand",
            "key": "mikemccand",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"
            },
            "displayName": "Michael McCandless",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "America/New_York"
          },
          "body": "Thanks Simon.\n\nIt should still be opening an NRT reader: if you have an NRT reader (which we do here) and pass that to IR.openIfChanged, you'll always get back a new NRT reader (this is the contract of IR.openIfChanged).\n\nSo I believe passing writer here wasn't necessary?",
          "updateAuthor": {
            "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/user?username=mikemccand",
            "name": "mikemccand",
            "key": "mikemccand",
            "avatarUrls": {
              "48x48": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?avatarId=10452",
              "24x24": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=small&avatarId=10452",
              "16x16": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=xsmall&avatarId=10452",
              "32x32": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/secure/useravatar?size=medium&avatarId=10452"
            },
            "displayName": "Michael McCandless",
            "active": true,
            "timeZone": "America/New_York"
          },
          "created": "2011-10-15T16:05:28.011+0000",
          "updated": "2011-10-15T16:05:28.011+0000"
        },
        {
          "self": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/rest/api/2/issue/12527297/comment/13128283",
          "id": "13128283",
